OL,3,GNEWSAWe live in the Town of the Year -
OL,4,Awhat makes it so good?
OL,5,
OL,6,FInverurie has been named Scotland's
OL,7,FTown of the Year - in recognition of
OL,8,Flocals "turning ideas into action".
OL,10,FJudges for the Scotland Loves Local
OL,11,Fawards - organised by Scotland's Towns
OL,12,FPartnership - selected the
OL,13,FAberdeenshire community ahead of
OL,14,FKirkwall, Fort William, Falkirk and
OL,15,FEast Kilbride, which had also been
OL,16,Fshortlisted.
OL,18,FThe town has bucked the trend of town
OL,19,Fcentre decline, with residents rallying
OL,20,Fbehind local traders, boosting footfall
OL,21,Ffor long-established businesses and
OL,22,Fnewcomers alike.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
