OL,3,GNEWSAWe live in the Town of the Year -
OL,4,Awhat makes it so good?
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne local businessman, Stephen Bruce,
OL,7,Fsaid: "There's a great community spirit
OL,8,F- the town comes together really well."
